# Competency question (native gmeow:reasoningLogic lane, #1294): "Does the homomorphic-
# encryption law Dec(E(a) ⊗ E(b)) = a ⊕ b, evaluated as a real logic:Formula over concrete
# ciphertexts, ENTAIL that the decrypted product equals the plaintext sum?"  ctMul/ptAdd are
# fixed-arity n-ary body atoms (reified) joined with the binary enc/dec atoms; firing the law
# DERIVES the binary consequent eq(heWp, heWp), present in the closure only because the law
# fired. VALUES pins the query to the HE witness. Over the closure the answer is exactly {heWp}.
PREFIX exa: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/math/algebra/>

SELECT ?value WHERE {
    VALUES ?value { exa:heWp }
    ?value exa:eqRel ?value .
}
